      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Your son Elijah b. Zechariah</li>\n<li>To the most illustrious elder, the illustrious Kohen Abu \u02bel-\u02bfAl\u0101\u02be, m(ay his) R(ock) k(eep him).</li>\n<li>If you wish to revive the knowledge of the</li>\n<li>sections of the Bible which you have studied &mdash; your servant is at your disposal. And also at</li>\n<li>that of your father, the Dean of the Kohens, (may his) R(ock) k(eep him). If coming</li>\n<li>to me causes you embarrassment and shame, I am prepared to come to your noble home....&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
